	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r23r0101_trainerw_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あなたの　ポケモン……
バッチリじゃ　ないわね！▼
さ！　えんりょせずに
やすんで　いきなさいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:01:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T03:54:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あなたの　ポケモン……
バッチリじゃ　ないわね！▼
さ！　遠慮せずに
休んで　いきなさいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:01:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T03:54:42" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・HP/PP満タンでない時
　続けて画面暗転して回復処理</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T03:54:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERW</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T05:02:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T05:15:58" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
